BaseConfigLib::initializeModeConfig
├── given valid 4-byte config
│   ├── it should write modeConfig to storage
│   ├── it should return the PolicyConfig
│   └── it should return remaining calldata after 4 bytes
├── given all zeros config
│   └── it should store zero config (all SKIP)
├── given all fields enabled
│   └── it should store all fields correctly
└── given extra data after config
    └── it should return extra data as remaining